sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User as 👥 User
    participant ALB as 🔄 Load Balancer
    participant OSCAL as 🖥️ OSCAL App
    participant Lambda as 🔧 Lambda
    participant ASG as ⚙️ Auto Scaling
    participant Ollama as 🤖 Ollama AI
    participant CW as ⏰ CloudWatch
    
    Note over Ollama: Status: SLEEPING - Scaled to 0
    
    User->>ALB: 1. Access Application
    ALB->>OSCAL: Route to Blue/Green
    OSCAL->>User: Render UI
    
    Note over User,OSCAL: User views reports - no AI needed<br/>Ollama remains sleeping $0/hour
    
    User->>OSCAL: 2. Click "AI Suggest Controls"
    OSCAL->>Lambda: Trigger: Wake Ollama
    
    Note over Lambda,ASG: Check current state
    Lambda->>ASG: Set Desired Capacity = 1
    
    Note over ASG,Ollama: Starting instance...<br/>This takes 2 to 3 minutes
    ASG->>Ollama: Launch t3.xlarge instance
    Ollama->>Ollama: Load Mistral 7B model
    
    Note over Ollama: Status: ACTIVE<br/>Cost: $0.1664/hour
    
    Ollama->>Lambda: Instance Ready
    Lambda->>OSCAL: Ollama Available
    
    OSCAL->>Ollama: Send AI Request
    Ollama->>OSCAL: AI Response
    OSCAL->>User: Display Suggestions
    
    Note over User,Ollama: User continues working<br/>Multiple AI requests for 2 hours
    
    User->>OSCAL: More AI Queries
    OSCAL->>Ollama: Process Requests
    Ollama->>OSCAL: Return Results
    
    Note over Ollama: Last Activity at 12:00 PM<br/>Idle Timer Started
    
    loop Every 30 minutes
        CW->>Lambda: Check Idle Status
        Lambda->>Lambda: Check Last Activity Time
        alt Idle less than 4 hours
            Note over Lambda: Still within timeout<br/>Keep running
        end
    end
    
    Note over CW,Ollama: 4 hours pass with no AI activity<br/>Last activity at 12:00 PM<br/>Current time 4:00 PM
    
    CW->>Lambda: Idle Check at 4:00 PM
    Lambda->>Lambda: Idle Duration over 4 hours
    Lambda->>ASG: Set Desired Capacity = 0
    ASG->>Ollama: Terminate Instance
    
    Note over Ollama: Status: SLEEPING - Scaled to 0<br/>Cost: $0/hour
    
    Note over User,Ollama: User returns at 5:00 PM<br/>Needs AI again
    
    User->>OSCAL: New AI Request
    OSCAL->>Lambda: Wake Ollama Again
    Lambda->>ASG: Scale Up to 1
    
    Note over Ollama: Waking up 2 to 3 min<br/>Then ACTIVE again
